note FixRound2Ng answer to bay 1's review of 36edfca2: lstat with an output under 128 bytes traps 3 before any
note kernel call (OMEGESE s10), with or without ngrun --scratch; the confinement refusal (119) comes after it.
fn main to int
a = new uchar 1 97
b = new uchar 64 0
k = lstat a 0 1 b 0 64
ret int and k 255
end
